flowchart TD
    A[Curator clicks "Blacklist" button] --> B{Confirm Dialog?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Set removingIds to fade asset]
    C --> D[Call blacklistTitle() via customMutation]
    D --> E{Success?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Show Toast: "Blacklisted ✅"]
    F --> G[Asset hidden from list]
    E -- No --> H[Show Error Toast ❌]
    H --> I[Remove from removingIds to un-fade]
    B -- No --> J[Do nothing]
